      <Docs>
        <summary>
            The location of the delimited text storage.             Please note
            Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.DatasetLocation is the base
            class. According to the scenario, a derived class of the base class
            might need to be assigned here, or this property needs to be casted to
            one of the possible derived classes.             The available derived
            classes include
            Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.AmazonS3CompatibleLocation,
            Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.AmazonS3Location,
            Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.AzureBlobFSLocation,
            Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.AzureBlobStorageLocation,
            Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.AzureDataLakeStoreLocation,
            Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.AzureFileStorageLocation,
            Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.FileServerLocation,
            Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.FtpServerLocation,
            Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.GoogleCloudStorageLocation,
            Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.HdfsLocation,
            Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.HttpServerLocation,
            Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.LakeHouseLocation,
            Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.OracleCloudStorageLocation
            and Azure.ResourceManager.DataFactory.Models.SftpLocation.
            </summary>
